@startuml F5.13-D01-carregar-formulario-atendimento
title F5.13-D01 — Carregar formulário de atendimento
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ServiceController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: /secretaria/atendimentos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /atendimentos/categorias
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT categorias
Postgres --> WebApp: 200
Sec -> WebApp: digita GRR
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /alunos?q=
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT no escopo
Postgres --> WebApp: candidatos
note right of WebApp
  preview de notificação
  só no React state
end note
WebApp --> Sec: formulário pronto

@enduml
